{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M5mwvxkS9Sqdn2bKjYvJQ7","type":"tool_result","content":"907\t### Ranking Complexity\n908\t\n909\tRisk: ranking becomes hard to reason about.\n910\t\n911\tControl: keep ranker feature-based and inspectable before any learned policy. Expose diagnostic scores.\n912\t\n913\t### Event Log Growth\n914\t\n915\tRisk: event storage becomes too large or slow.\n916\t\n917\tControl: append compact summaries on hot paths, spill large payloads, index by task/session/workspace, and support compaction snapshots.\n918\t\n919\t### Stale Memory Leakage\n920\t\n921\tRisk: agents trust outdated memory.\n922\t\n923\tControl: freshness indexes, graph-change-triggered verification, stale labels in all memory surfaces, and tests that stale memory cannot rank as trusted.\n924\t\n925\t### Scope Leakage\n926\t\n927\tRisk: user/org/branch memories leak into wrong workspaces.\n928\t\n929\tControl: scope-aware queries, enforced filters in store APIs, and negative tests.\n930\t\n931\t### Overfitting To Current Repo"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019RjXwCuf57BAKn88mWkE24","session_id":"88204e0b-a61b-4ed7-ba98-4fcc53be0768","uuid":"395fcce2-7db4-451a-8e9a-8d1d1dc9ed8c","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:33:06.474Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Write Phase 4+5 task briefs"}
