{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017uqsXg2jjMA6w32v7GfUuS","type":"tool_result","content":"172\t### 3. Event Log\n173\t\n174\tThe event log is append-only and replayable. It is the substrate that makes memory consolidation and usefulness measurement possible.\n175\t\n176\tRequired event types:\n177\t\n178\t- `AssistantTaskStarted`\n179\t- `ToolCalled`\n180\t- `ToolResult`\n181\t- `ContextBundleReturned`\n182\t- `MemoryRetrieved`\n183\t- `MemoryExpanded`\n184\t- `PlanCreated`\n185\t- `FileRead`\n186\t- `PatchApplied`\n187\t- `TestRunStarted`\n188\t- `TestRunCompleted`\n189\t- `DiagnosticObserved`\n190\t- `UserCorrection`\n191\t- `UserPreferenceObserved`\n192\t- `WorkflowSucceeded`\n193\t- `WorkflowFailed`\n194\t- `MemoryCreated`\n195\t- `MemoryUpdated`\n196\t- `MemoryInvalidated`\n197\t- `MemoryConsolidated`\n198\t\n199\tEvents should carry:\n200\t\n201\t- workspace id\n202\t- branch\n203\t- session id\n204\t- task id\n205\t- actor\n206\t- timestamp\n207\t- stable references to files, symbols, docs, events, and memories\n208\t- payload hash\n209\t- compact payload summary\n210\t- optional full payload location\n211\t\n212\tThe full event stream should not be injected into prompts. It exists for retrieval, audit, replay, metrics, and consolidation.\n213\t\n214\t### 4. Memory Graph\n215\t\n216\tMemory should be stored as typed claims and episodes, not loose notes."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019RjXwCuf57BAKn88mWkE24","session_id":"88204e0b-a61b-4ed7-ba98-4fcc53be0768","uuid":"920e9f50-8fda-4f7e-a13f-02eeb3cc56a7","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:33:07.267Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Write Phase 4+5 task briefs"}
